    "Tammad never changes server instructions. Assign tools explicitly after your administrator has tested them. Native tools do not support free custom prompts in Tammad." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tammad verändert die Servervorgaben nicht. Ordne Werkzeuge ausdrücklich zu, nachdem dein Administrator sie getestet hat. Native Werkzeuge unterstützen in Tammad keine freien eigenen Anweisungen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tammad never changes server instructions. Assign tools explicitly after your administrator has tested them. Native tools do not support free custom prompts in Tammad."
